{"step_index":169,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:11:17Z","input_tokens":3010,"cache_read_tokens":138560,"output_tokens":3063,"thinking":"Enhancements to the frontend are underway. A new email report button is being integrated into the header. Three new navigation tabs are also being added, corresponding to network, policy, and email functionality, with associated tab sections for each.\n\n\nThe network tab implementation is complete with metric cards, controls, and a sockets table including action buttons for blocking IPs, killing processes, and deep tracing. The policy tab now features allowlist/blocklist management with sub-tabs for allowed processes, blocked processes, and blocked IPs, along with a rule addition interface. SMTP configuration is implemented in the email tab, providing settings and testing functionality, and an email dispatch option triggered by critical threat detection. CSS styles for badges are added.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"/* AegisShield Cyber SOC Dashboard Styles */\\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\\n\\n:root {\\n  --bg-primary: #080c14;\\n  --bg-secondary: #0f172a;\\n  --bg-card: #131c31;\\n  --bg-card-hover: #192542;\\n  --border-color: #1e293b;\\n  --border-glow: #22d3ee33;\\n  --text-main: #f8fafc;\\n  --text-muted: #94a3b8;\\n  --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;\\n  --accent-emerald: #10b981;\\n  --accent-amber: #f59e0b;\\n  --accent-rose: #f43f5e;\\n  --accent-crimson: #ef4444;\\n  --accent-purple: #8b5cf6;\\n}\\n\\n* {\\n  box-sizing: border-box;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\\n  background-color: var(--bg-primary);\\n  color: var(--text-main);\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  overflow-x: hidden;\\n  background-image: \\n    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%),\\n  