{"step_index":185,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:15:00Z","input_tokens":2764,"cache_read_tokens":177290,"output_tokens":2763,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# 🛡️ AegisShield EDR - Cyber Process Monitor & Threat Eradicator\\n\\n> **Advanced Real-Time Spyware, Antivirus, Remote Desktop Control (LOLRMM), Process Monitor, Network Origin Tracer, Access Control & Trojan Detection Dashboard**\\n> *Scans your system, identifies threats via multi-vector heuristics and threat intelligence, audits network connections, enforces allow/block rules, dispatches email reports, and kills threats with a single click.*\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🌟 Key Features\\n\\n### 1. 🛡️ Access Control & Allow / Block Policy Engine\\n* **Allowlist (Whitelist):** Explicitly trust processes by **Name**, **Executable Path**, or **SHA256 Hash**. Whitelisted software is assigned a Threat Score of 0, alerts are suppressed, and it is exempt from termination.\\n* **Blocklist (Blacklist):** Ban known malicious processes or scripts. Any process matching a blacklist rule is flagged as `CRITICAL` (Score: 100) and can be immediately eradicated.\\n* **IP Banning & Windows Firewall Integration:** Ban suspicious remote IP addresses. AegisShield creates outbound rules in Windows Firewall (`netsh advfirewall firewall add rule ...`) and flags any process attempting communication with banned IPs.\\n* **Quick UI Actions:** 1-click **Allow** and **Block** buttons located on every process row and threat card.\\n\\n### 2. 🌐 Network Radar & IP Origin Tracer\\n* **Network Process Auditing:** Discovers exactly which processes are using network sockets, mapping local ports to remote IP endpoints.\\n* **Origin & Geolocation Tracing:** Resolves remote IPs using reverse DNS (PTR records) and geographic lookup (Country, Organization, ISP, and ASN).\\n* **Genuineness & Reputation Classification:** Automatically assesses whether an endpoint is legitimate:\\n  * 🟢 **`GENUINE CLOUD / CDN`**: Verified major tech infrastructure (Microsoft/Azure, Google/GCP, Cloudflare, Amazon AWS, Apple, Akamai, GitHub, Fastly).\\n  * 🔵 **`PRIVATE LAN`**: Safe local subnet (`192.168.x.x`, `10.x.x.x`, `172.16-31.x.x`, `127.0.0.1`).\\n  * 🔴 **`SUSPICIOUS C2 / \n<truncated 8436 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\thann\\\\Downloads\\\\AntiGravity\\\\SpywareProcessMon\\\\README.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
